This directory bundles a trimmed copy of the upstream ConceptAttention
package by Helbling et al. (ICML 2025) — only the modules imported by our
`main.py` / `generate.py`.

Upstream source: https://github.com/helblazer811/ConceptAttention (MIT).

The nested `flux/` subpackage is the FLUX.1 reference implementation by
Black Forest Labs, used unmodified — its license is preserved at
`flux/LICENSE` (Apache 2.0).
